{"t": 7319, "msg": {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011Ch9t9xHL62wgMbPKN73u5", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Five commits landed on phase-c, newest first.\n\nThe newest saves conversations. It adds an off-by-default saveChats setting with a retention choice, a new chats module that keeps one owner-only file per chat, and a chat list and viewer in the settings overlay. It also adds voice commands like \"new chat\" and \"continue the chat about\", and a chats command in the CLI. Tests stand at 1393 passing, and the installer box is 9 of 9.\n\nBefore that, each voice agent got a display name and a stable id, separate from its wake phrase. Old lists are migrated without moving any grants, and a new mainName setting names the main agent.\n\nThe third fixes a crash. A stop signal arriving during the PortAudio import could segfault the daemon on restart, so that import now runs with the signal deferred. It reproduced 12 of 12 times before the fix and 0 of 12 after.\n\nThe fourth adds an adaptive microphone gate that follows room noise, and an accurate live transcript mode where Whisper's text replaces Vosk's at each pause.\n\nThe oldest improves wake testing. It makes the manual test visible, adds an automatic test across all installed voices, adds second-check controls, and adds a \"full stop\" phrase that works at any time."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 5269, "cache_read_input_tokens": 25157, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 5269}, "output_tokens": 401, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "a9b2af15-184e-4556-9153-c0c6c1d0b056", "uuid": "af9229f9-f317-4313-a6a9-